<div class="big_text">
<<nobr>>

    <div class="scene-container">

        <!-- EXAMPLE IMAGE -->
        <img class="scene-image" @src="setup.ImagePath+'scenes/char/mc/5.png'">

        <!-- EXAMPLE STORY BOX -->
        <div class="story-box">
            <p> Then in a fit of fright, I opened my eyes and saw the familiar poster of top anime waifus on my ceiling wall. I was back in my room, in my bed with the hoax of the room light bearing down on me. At first, I thought everything was just a very vivid dream, or a nightmare, especially when I turned to my left side and saw that my arm was still there. 
            </p>

            <div class="dialogue-row mc">
                <img @src="setup.ImagePath+'scenes/avatar/mc.png'" alt="MC" class="avatar">
                <div class="dialogue-box">
                    <div class="name"><<print $mc.name>>: </div>
                    <p> "What the fuck," I said to myself as I looked at the mirror, and looked back at myself.  
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- EXAMPLE BUTTON -->
        <div class="enter-button" onclick="forwardTime(1)" data-passage="Home" style="width:25vw;">
            <p >Leave</p>
        </div>
    
    </div>

<</nobr>>
</div>